0.048920069056207
 41
3.925195761007237
 46
0.0
 71
     1
 72
     5
  3
EACH PANEL SHALL CONTROL ONE 2 HP, 230 VOLT, SINGLE PHASE, 60 Hz PUMPS. \PPANEL ENCLOSURE SHALL BE NEMA 4X, FABRICATED FROM FIBERGLASS OR ALUMINUM. \POUTER DOOR SHALL HAVE HINGES AND MEANS FOR PADLOCKING.  ALL MOUNTING HOLES SHALL BE DRILLED AND TAPP
  3
ED, SELF TAPPING SCREW NOT ACCEPTABLE. ALL BOLTS, NUTS, LOCK WASHERS, AND MACHINE SCREWS SHALL BE STAINLESS STEEL. \PTHE FOLLOWING MAJOR COMPONENTS ARE REQUIRED: \P1)  PUMP BREAKER \P2)  CONTROL CIRCUIT BREAKER \P3)  HIGH LEVEL FLASHING ALARM LIGHT \
  3
P4)  HIGH LEVEL HORN ALARM WITH SILENCE - WHEN SILENCE LIGHT STAYS ON \P5)  MOTOR CONTACTOR. (OVERLOAD PROTECTION IN PUMP)TION  \P6) CAPACITORS ARE INTERNAL TO PUMP.\P\PNOTES:\P\PWET WELL MUST HAVE LOCKABLE HATCH OR OTHER APPROPRIATE FEATURES TO DISC
  3
OURAGE THE ENTRY OF ANIMALS OR UNAUTHORIZED PERSONS.\P\PTHE OWNER SHALL CONTRACT THE SERVICES OF A CERTIFIED LIFT STATION SERVICE COMPANY TO SERVICE AND MAINTAIN ALL SYSTEM COMPONENTS WITHIN PRIVATE PROPERTY.  THE UTILITY COMPANY SHALL BE RESPONSIBLE
  1
 FOR ALL COMPONENTS WITHIN THE PUBLIC RIGHT OF WAY. \P\PTHE CERTIFIED LIFT STATION SERVICE COMPANY SHALL HAVE AS A MINIMUM, ONE SPARE PART OF ALL SYSTEM COMPONENTS. 
