\pt0.6742,1.44472;{\LNOTES:\P\ptz;}\P\pi-0.09631,l0.09631,t0.09631,0.14447;1.^ITHIS LOW PRESSURE (LP) SEWER SERVICE ARRANGEMENT IS FOR " SPECIAL CASES ONLY " AND MUST FIRST BE APPROVED BY JEA  PRIOR TO DESIGN OR CONSTRUCTION.  THIS LOW PRESSURE SEWER 
  3
MANIFOLD ARRANGEMENT MAY  BE UTILIZED TO SERVE UP TO 20 EQUIVALENT RESIDENTIAL UNITS (ERU)AND SHALL BE PERMITTED SIMILAR TO A GRAVITY SEWER MAIN.  THIS STANDARD SHALL APPLY TO RESIDENTIAL CUSTOMERS ONLY.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-0.09631,l0.09631,t0.09631,0.
  3
14447;2.^IRESIDENTIAL PUMP STATION (PS) SHALL BE MAINTAINED BY THE CUSTOMER AND SHALL MEET EPB RULE No.3 (DUVAL COUNTY).  THE CUSTOMER IS RESPONSIBLE FOR FINAL PUMP DESIGN AND SELECTION.  A CHECK VALVE AND BALL VALVE SHALL BE PROVIDED AT THE PS AND MA
  3
INTAINED BY THE CUSTOMER.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-0.09631,l0.09631,t0.09631,0.14447;3.^IEACH CUSTOMER SHALL HAVE A SEPARATE "LOW PRESSURE SERVICE CONNECTION POINT" (SEE ABOVE DETAIL). THE CHECK VALVE LOCATED IN THE BOX SHALL DEFINE THE "POINT OF SERVICE".  
  3
THIS BOX (2" METER BOX WITH PVC PLUG IN TOP) SHALL BE APPROXIMATELY 7 FEET INSIDE THE R/W AND A MINIMUM OF 6 FEET FROM THE WATER METER BOX (IN FRONT OF CUSTOMER HOME).\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-0.09631,l0.09631,t0.09631,0.14447;4.^ILOW PRESSURE FORCE MAIN DRO
  3
P CONNECTION AT M/H SHALL INCLUDE A 4" GATE VALVE AND BE IN ACCORDANCE WITH JEA STANDARD PLATE No. S-18.   FOR OTHER LOCATION LIMITATIONS SEE DETAIL (W-10 & W-11).\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-0.09631,l0.09631,t0.09631,0.14447;5.^IALL PUMP STATIONS, PIPES (W/LOC
  3
ATE WIRE), VALVES AND FITTINGS WHICH ARE MAINTAINED BY JEA SHALL BE OF JEA APPROVED MATERIALS AND SHALL BE CONSTRUCTED IN ACCORDANCE WITH JEA W&S STANDARD\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-0.09631,l0.09631,t0.09631,0.14447;6.^IPER DEP RULES AND EPB RULE No.3, A LOW P
  3
RESSURE PUMP STATION CONNECTION INTO A JEA FORCE MAIN IS NOT ALLOWED. (NO EXCEPTIONS).\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-0.09631,l0.09631,t0.09631,0.14447;7.^IAS BUILTS FOR ALL UTILITIES WITHIN THE R/W SHALL BE PROVIDED TO JEA IN ACCORDANCE WITH JEA STANDARDS. \P\pi0
  3
,l0,tz;\P\pi-0.09631,l0.09631,t0.09631,0.14447;8.^ILOCATE WIRE IS REQUIRED ALONG THE MAIN PIPING AND SERVICE LATERALS TO THE LAST CUSTOMER CONNECTION BOX. (AS SHOWN IN DETAIL)\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-0.09631,l0.09631,t0.09631,0.14447;9.^IFOR RESIDENTIAL CUST
  3
OMERS LOCATED IN AREAS OF LOW ELEVATION, THE CUSTOMER MAY  BE REQUIRED TO OPERATE AND MAINTAIN A LOW PRESSURE PUMP STATION (SEE NOTE #2) WHICH MAY  DISCHARGE INTO A 6 INCH GRAVITY SEWER SERVICE LATERAL.  IN THESE CASES, THE CUSTOMER SHALL PROVIDE AND
  1
 MAINTAIN A 4 INCH CLEAN-OUT LOCATED AT THE CONNECTION POINT (AT R/W LINE).
  7
