{\LNOTES :\P}\P\pi-0.14447,l0.19263,t0.19263;1.^ITO MARK THE LOCATION OF THE 6" PLUG FOR NEW SERVICE: FOR PROJECTS WHERE NO CONCRETE CURB EXIST, AN ELECTRONIC "SEWER" MARKER IS REQUIRED FOR ALL LATERALS WHICH ARE BEING INSTALL FOR FUTURE USE AT A MAX 
  3
DEPTH OF 3' AT FINISH GRADE. FOR NEW DEVELOPMENT AREAS WHERE THE SEWER LATERAL IS "NOT IN USE", A LANDSCAPE TIMBER OR 3x3 MIN. P.T. POST (TOP PAINTED GREEN) SHALL BE INSTALLED. WHERE REQUIRED BY JEA OR NO CONCRETE CURB EXIST, AN ELECTRONIC "SEWER" MA
  3
RKER SHALL BE INSTALLED TO MARKER SHALL ALSO BE INSTALLED.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-0.14447,l0.19263,t0.19263;2.^ITHE MINIMUM SIZE OF ALL HOUSE LATERALS SHALL BE 6 INCHES. THE MAXIMUM LENGTH OF A HOUSE LATERAL SHALL BE 60 FEET (LENGTH BETWEEN SEWER MAIN OR M
  3
ANHOLE TO CUSTOMERS PROPERTY LINE).\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-0.14447,l0.19263,t0.19263;3.^ISEE MEASUREMENT AND PAYMENT SECTION FOR MAXIMUM PAYMENT WIDTHS.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-0.14447,l0.19263,t0.19263;4.^I ALL GRAVITY SEWER MAINS AND ASSOCIATED SEWER LATERAL PI
  3
PE AND FITTINGS (INCLUDING THE TEE-WYE FITTINGS) SHALL BE PVC SDR-26.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-0.14447,l0.19263,t0.19263;5.^IUNLESS APPROVED OTHERWISE BY A JEA O&M MANAGER, NO GRAVITY SEWER MAIN WITH SEWER SERVICE LATERALS SHALL BE CONSTRUCTED WITH A "DEPTH 
  3
OF CUT" GREATER THAN 12 FEET.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-0.14447,l0.19263,t0.19263;6.^ISEWER SERVICE LATERALS ASSOCIATED WITH GRAVITY SEWER MAINS WHICH ARE DEEPER THAN 12 FEET, MUST BE ROUTED TO A GRAVITY SEWER HIGH-LINE, A MANHOLE OR OTHER JEA APPROVED METHOD
  3
.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-0.14447,l0.19263,t0.19263;7.^ITHE SEWER SERVICE LATERAL SHALL BE CONSTRUCTED AT A DEPTH TO ALLOW A GRAVITY CONNECTION BY THE CUSTOMER, WHERE POSSIBLE (CONTINGENT UPON MEETING THE CUSTOMER'S ON-SITE CONDITIONS AND LOCAL CONSTRUCTION
  1
 STANDARDS). A LATERAL REQUIRING MORE THAN 60" OF COVER MUST BE APPROVED, PRIOR TO CONSTRUCTION, BY JEA.
  7
