\A1;{\LNOTES:}\P\P\pi-0.14447,l0.19263,t0.19263;1.^IFOR UNPAVED LOCATIONS, A PRECAST CONCRETE VALVE PAD SHALL BE PROVIDED AND INSTALLED FLUSH WITH GRADE. CONCRETE PAD IS NOT REQUIRED FOR VALVE LOCATED IN THE ROADWAY, UNLESS SHOWN OR NOTED OTHERWISE.\P
  3
\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-0.14447,l0.19263,t0.19263;2.^ILOCATING WIRE IS REQUIRED ON ALL PRESSURE PIPING (SEE DETAILW-44).\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-0.14447,l0.19263,t0.19263;3.^IA "V" CUT SHALL BE CARVED IN THE CURB CLOSEST/ADJACENT/( ASPHALT IF NO CURB) TO ALL BELOW 
  3
GRADE VALVES. THE "V" CUT IS TO BE PAINTED BLUE WATER/PURPLE RECLAIMED.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-0.14447,l0.19263,t0.19263;4.^IIN PAVED AREAS, INSTALL VALVE AT A DEPTH TO ALLOW A 12" MIN. DISTANCE BETWEEN THE VALVE COVER PLATE AND THE TOP OF THE VALVE OPERAT
  3
ING NUT. OUTSIDE OF PAVED AREAS (GRASS), INSTALL VALVE AT A DEPTH TO ALLOW A 6" MINIMUM DISTANCE BETWEEN THE VALVE COVER AND THE TOP OF THE VALVE OPERATING NUT. OPERATING NUT/STEM EXTENSION SHALL BE PROVIDED (WHERE APPLICABLE) SO THAT THE OPERATING N
  3
UT WILL BE NO MORE THAN 30 INCHES BELOW FINISHED GRADE.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-0.14447,l0.19263,t0.19263;5.^IFOR NEW CONSTRUCTION, THE VALVE BOX SHALL BE ADJUSTED TO MIDRANGE TO ALLOW FOR FUTURE BOX ADJUSTMENTS. ROUTE LOCATE WIRES THRU A "V" CUT IN THE TOP
  3
 OF THE 6" PVC RISER PIPE FOR LOCATE WIRE ACCESS INTO VALVE BOX. THE LOCATE WIRES WITH A 24" LONG PIG-TAIL AT THE TOP SHALL BE CONNECTED TOGETHER WITH A WIRE NUT.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-0.14447,l0.19263,t0.19263;6.^IBRASS IDENTIFICATION TAG INDICATING "WAT
  3
ER", VALVE SIZE, DIRECTION AND TURNS TO OPEN & VALVE TYPE. PROVIDE A {\H0.7x;\S1#4;}" HOLE IN BRASS TAG AND ATTACH  TAG (TWIST WIRE AROUND TAG) TO THE END OF THE LOCATE WIRE. TAGS ARE NOT REQUIRED ON VALVES INSTALLED ON FIRE HYDRANT BRANCH LINES.\P\p
  3
i0,l0,tz;\P\pi-0.14447,l0.19263,t0.19263;7.^IIN LIEU OF PRECAST CONCRETE PAD, A 6" THICK X 24" (ROUND OR SQUARE) POURED CONCRETE PAD W/2 - #4 REBAR AROUND PERIMETER, MAY BE USED.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-0.14447,l0.19263,t0.19263;8.^IGRAVEL SHALL BE PROVIDED 
  3
UNDER ALL VALVES 20" AND LARGER. THE MINIMUM VERTICAL LIMIT OF GRAVEL IS 12" UNDER THE VALVE UP TO {\H0.7x;\S1#3;} THE OVERALL HEIGHT OF THE VALVE.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-0.14447,l0.19263,t0.19263;9.^IFOR VALVES 12 INCH AND SMALLER, PROVIDE A WHITE OR BLAC
  3
K PLASTIC DEBRIS SHIELD WHICH INSTALLS BELOW THE OPERATING NUT. THIS SHIELD SHALL CENTER THE RISER PIPE BOX OVER THE OPERATING NUT AND MINIMIZE INFILTRATION. SHIELD SHALL BE BY AFC, BOXLOK OR APPROVED EQUAL.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-0.14447,l0.19263,t0.1926
  1
3;10.^IALL VALVES SHALL BE INSTALLED WITH AN ELECTRIC LOCATE MARKER. MARKER SHALL BE 4" DIA. COLOR CODED BALL MARKER (3M-1403XR FOR WATER AND 1408XR FOR RECLAIMED WATER).
  7
