193413874.0
  1
THE WATER TAPS DEPICTED ON THESE DESIGN PLANS SHALL BE CONSTRUCTED AS FOLLOWS:  ALL POTABLE AND IRRIGATION WATER TAPS, FIRE LINE SERVICES AND FIRE HYDRANT INSTALLATIONS SHALL BE PERFORMED BY A LICENSED MASTER PLUMBER OR UNDERGROUND UTILITY CONTRACTOR
  1
 UNDER THE FOLLOWING SPECIAL CONDITIONS:\P\pxi-3,l3,t3;1.^ITHE TAPS ARE TO BE SCHEDULED 48 HOURS IN ADVANCE. CONTACT YOUR JEA INSPECTOR.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-3,l3,t3;2.^ITAPS REQUIRING METER INSTALLATIONS OF SIZE 2" AND BELOW MUST INCLUDE THE SERVICE PIPE
  1
, METER BOX, AND CORP. STOP SIZED READY TO ACCEPT THE METER INSTALLATION BY JEA FORCES.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-3,l3,t3;3.^IJEA FORCES WILL INSTALL THE METER UPON APPLICATION AND PAYMENT BY LICENSED MASTER PLUMBER OR UTILITY CONTRACTOR AT JEA WATER AND SEWE
  1
R, 515 N. LAURA ST., 1ST FLOOR CUSTOMER SERVICE BUILDING.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-3,l3,t3;4.^IALL TAPS REQUIRING METER INSTALLATIONS OF SIZE 3" AND ABOVE SHALL TERMINATE SIZED READY FOR VAULT, METER AND BYPASS INSTALLATION BY JEA FORCES.  \P\pi0,l0,tz;\PWAT
  1
ER AND SEWER CAPACITY FEES SHALL BE REQUIRED AT TIME OF METER APPLICATION. FEES WILL BE BASED ON TOTAL NUMBER OF PLUMBING FIXTURE UNITS SHOWN OR LISTED ON BUILDING PLANS.  \P\PALL WATER AND SEWER CONSTRUCTION MATERIALS TO BE CONSTRUCTED IN CITY RIGHT
  1
-OF-WAY OR JEA EASEMENT MUST BE IN CONFORMANCE WITH THE JEA APPROVED MATERIALS MANUAL FOR WATER AND SEWER.  \P\PA PRE-CONSTRUCTION CONFERENCE IS REQUIRED AND SHALL BE SCHEDULED WITH CHRIS BARRINGTON; JEA DEVELOPMENT 904-665-4081 \P\PMETER TO BE INSTA
  1
LLED BY JEA WATER AND SEWER FORCES UPON APPLICATION AND PAYMENT BY LICENSED MASTER PLUMBER OR UTILITY CONTRACTOR, 515 N. LAURA ST. 1ST FLOOR CUSTOMER SERVICE BUILDING.  \P\PALL WATER MAINS SHALL BE PRESSURE TESTED AT 150 PSI FOR 2 HOURS AND FORCE MAI
  1
NS SHALL BE TESTED AT 100 PSI FOR 2 HOURS IN ACCORDANCE WITH SECTION "A" OF AWWA STANDARD C600 WITH LEAKAGE LIMITED TO THAT DETERMINED BY THE APPROPRIATE FORMULA.  \P\PDISINFECTION OF THE WATER MAIN SHALL BE PERFORMED IN ACCORDANCE WITH AWWA C651.  \
  1
P\PMECHANICAL JOINT RESTRAINTS SHALL CONFORM TO AWWA STANDARD C509.  \P\PALL ONSITE PRIVATE WATER AND SEWER CONSTRUCTION AND MATERIALS SHALL CONFORM TO CURRENT JEA AND FDEP STANDARDS AND SPECIFICATIONS.  \P\PSHOP DRAWINGS ON ALL BACKFLOW PREVENTORS S
  1
HALL BE SUBMITTED TO JEA FOR APPROVAL PRIOR TO INSTALLATION.  CONTACT BILL POUND @ 904-665-5787.
  0
