\A1;{\LNOTES:}\P\P\pxi-3,l4,t4;1.^IFOR UNPAVED LOCATIONS, A PRECAST CONCRETE VALVE PAD SHALL BE PROVIDED AND INSTALLED FLUSH WITH GRADE. CONCRETE PAD IS NOT REQUIRED FOR VALVE LOCATED IN THE ROADWAY, UNLESS SHOWN OR NOTED OTHERWISE.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-
  1
3,l4,t4;2.^ILOCATING WIRE IS REQUIRED ON ALL PRESSURE PIPING (SEE DETAILW-44).\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-3,l4,t4;3.^IA "V" CUT SHALL BE CARVED IN THE CURB CLOSEST/ADJACENT/( ASPHALT IF NO CURB) TO ALL BELOW GRADE VALVES. THE "V" CUT IS TO BE PAINTED BLUE WATER
  1
/PURPLE RECLAIMED.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-3,l4,t4;4.^IIN PAVED AREAS, INSTALL VALVE AT A DEPTH TO ALLOW A 12" MIN. DISTANCE BETWEEN THE VALVE COVER PLATE AND THE TOP OF THE VALVE OPERATING NUT. OUTSIDE OF PAVED AREAS (GRASS), INSTALL VALVE AT A DEPTH TO AL
  1
LOW A 6" MINIMUM DISTANCE BETWEEN THE VALVE COVER AND THE TOP OF THE VALVE OPERATING NUT. OPERATING NUT/STEM EXTENSION SHALL BE PROVIDED (WHERE APPLICABLE) SO THAT THE OPERATING NUT WILL BE NO MORE THAN 30 INCHES BELOW FINISHED GRADE.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\
  1
pi-3,l4,t4;5.^IFOR NEW CONSTRUCTION, THE VALVE BOX SHALL BE ADJUSTED TO MIDRANGE TO ALLOW FOR FUTURE BOX ADJUSTMENTS. ROUTE LOCATE WIRES THRU A "V" CUT IN THE TOP OF THE 6" PVC RISER PIPE FOR LOCATE WIRE ACCESS INTO VALVE BOX. THE LOCATE WIRES WITH A 
  1
24" LONG PIG-TAIL AT THE TOP SHALL BE CONNECTED TOGETHER WITH A WIRE NUT.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-3,l4,t4;6.^IBRASS IDENTIFICATION TAG INDICATING "WATER", VALVE SIZE, DIRECTION AND TURNS TO OPEN & VALVE TYPE. PROVIDE A {\H0.7x;\S1#4;}" HOLE IN BRASS TAG AND
  1
 ATTACH  TAG (TWIST WIRE AROUND TAG) TO THE END OF THE LOCATE WIRE. TAGS ARE NOT REQUIRED ON VALVES INSTALLED ON FIRE HYDRANT BRANCH LINES.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-3,l4,t4;7.^IIN LIEU OF PRECAST CONCRETE PAD, A 6" THICK X 24" (ROUND OR SQUARE) POURED CONCRE
  1
TE PAD W/2 - #4 REBAR AROUND PERIMETER, MAY BE USED.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-3,l4,t4;8.^IGRAVEL SHALL BE PROVIDED UNDER ALL VALVES 20" AND LARGER. THE MINIMUM VERTICAL LIMIT OF GRAVEL IS 12" UNDER THE VALVE UP TO {\H0.7x;\S1#3;} THE OVERALL HEIGHT OF THE VA
  1
LVE.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-3,l4,t4;9.^IFOR VALVES 12 INCH AND SMALLER, PROVIDE A WHITE OR BLACK PLASTIC DEBRIS SHIELD WHICH INSTALLS BELOW THE OPERATING NUT. THIS SHIELD SHALL CENTER THE RISER PIPE BOX OVER THE OPERATING NUT AND MINIMIZE INFILTRATION. SHI
  1
ELD SHALL BE BY AFC, BOXLOK OR APPROVED EQUAL.\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\pi-3,l4,t4;10.^IALL VALVES SHALL BE INSTALLED WITH AN ELECTRIC LOCATE MARKER. MARKER SHALL BE 4" DIA. COLOR CODED BALL MARKER (3M-1403XR FOR WATER AND 1408XR FOR RECLAIMED WATER).
  0
